#====================================================================
# DRAFT-pybind11-2.10.1-header-only-nopython-python-include
# pybind11 header-only 配方：PYBIND11_NOPYTHON 零依赖构建 + test_package
# 宿主 Python include 注入；export_sources() 需 import helper
# 触发/来源: pybind11 2.10.1 R01 全量适配（pc1-13, 2026-09-05）
#    G2/G3/G4 + W3 L0/L1 全程实证；修复前捕获 G1/G2 与双重声明证据
#====================================================================

# ═══ Layer 0: 错误面 (Error Surface) ═══
id:                     DRAFT-pybind11-2.10.1-header-only-nopython-python-include
source_lib:             pybind11 2.10.1
trigger_tool:           conan create|conan-verify|cmake|test_package|w3
phase:                  configuration|build|test|packaging|export
error_signature:        Python\.h.*not found|find_package\(PythonLibsNew.*REQUIRED|
                        PYBIND11_NOPYTHON|PYBIND11_TEST|sysconfig.*include|
                        export_conandata_patches is not defined|NameError.*export_conandata_patches|
                        CMakeToolchain is declared in the generators attribute.*generate\(\) method|
                        header-only.*Python\.h|pybind11.*Python\.h

# ═══ Layer 1: 识别层 (Recognition) ═══
severity:               2
category:               ohos, header-only, cmake, conan, packaging, python, binding
match_keywords:         pybind11, PYBIND11_NOPYTHON, PYBIND11_TEST, Python.h, sysconfig,
                        PYTHON_INCLUDE_DIR, header-library, export_conandata_patches,
                        NameError, CMakeToolchain, generators, find_package(PythonLibsNew,
                        detail/common.h, test_package, cmake_system_name OHOS
title:                  pybind11 header-only 配方：PYBIND11_NOPYTHON=ON 构建期零 Python 依赖，test_package 注入宿主 Python include，export_sources() 须 import helper

# ═══ Layer 2: 诊断层 (Diagnosis) ═══
root_cause: >
  pybind11 detail/common.h 无条件 #include <Python.h>，消费者 TU 均需 Python 开发头；
  OHOS 工具链 sysroot 无 Python.h。pybind11 CMake 默认（PYBIND11_TEST 随 master
  project ON）会经 tools/pybind11Tools.cmake 调用 find_package(PythonLibsNew REQUIRED)，
  交叉构建阶段直接失败或串入宿主 Python。配方侧：header-only 库用 cmake 安装头文件
  与配置即可，显式 PYBIND11_NOPYTHON=ON + PYBIND11_TEST=OFF 即可零 Python 依赖；
  test_package 编译探测程序仍需 Python.h，用宿主 sysconfig include 注入；
  另 conanfile.py 手写 export_sources() 必须 import export_conandata_patches，
  test_package generators 与 generate() 不能双重声明 CMakeToolchain。
affected_scope: >
  OHOS armv8 clang15 下所有 pybind11 类 header-only 绑定库（pybind11/nanobind/
  boost::python 包装库）的 Conan 2.x 配方与 test_package；头文件硬依赖第三方
  开发头的库。
verification_cmd:       conan create archives/p/pybind11/2.10.1 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing

# ═══ Layer 3: 方案层 (Solution Space) ★ ═══
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           header-only-nopython-plus-host-python-include
rec_description: >
  (1) conanfile.py: package_type="header-library"，generate() 中 OHOS 守卫
      (cmake_system_name=OHOS/processor=aarch64) + PYBIND11_TEST=OFF +
      PYBIND11_INSTALL=ON + PYBIND11_NOPYTHON=ON；build()=CMake.configure/build，
      package()=CMake.install，package_info() 仅 includedirs + cmake target；
  (2) test_package: generate() 探测 sysconfig.get_paths()["include"] 注入
      PYTHON_INCLUDE_DIR（CMakeLists 条件 target_include_directories），
      test() 用 self.run 实跑探测二进制（满足 L0d self.run 要求）；
  (3) 配方/测试如有 export_sources() 必须 import export_conandata_patches；
      CMakeToolchain 只能出现在 generators 属性或 generate() 之一。
verification:           conan-verify G1/G0/G2/G3/G4 PASS；W3 L0/L1 PASS（Success: 1）；
                        test_package 二进制设备运行 exit 0 输出版本宏
applicability:          pybind11 类 header-only 绑定库；需构建真实 Python 扩展
                        (PYBIND11_TEST=ON) 时禁用 NOPYTHON；纯 python 项目不适用

# ═══ Layer 4: 知识面 (Knowledge) ═══
related_entries:        DRAFT-pybind11-2.10.1-lang-preflight-pybind11-cpp
notes:                  CMakeToolchain 双重声明与 export_sources 导入坑亦见
                        DRAFT-ctre-3.10.0-header-only-recipe-test-package（等价，
                        不重复建条目）；宿主 Python include 仅测试期注入，非包级依赖